      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Overdue reminders\nDaily: fetch overdue loans from Convex (signed). Convex already leaves out loans reminded today, and each reminder is keyed reminder:<loan>:<date>, so re-runs and retries never double-send or double-record. A failed send is still written back as \"failed\" so it shows on the loan; a failed write-back fails the run, which the error workflow reports.",
